WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.824 --> 00:00:04.152
(electronic music)

00:00:04.152 --> 00:00:06.040
- When I look at a floppy disk today,

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:07.949
I look at something that's valuable,

00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:11.873
and that I used, and yet,
when most people look at it,

00:00:11.873 --> 00:00:13.901
they'll look at it almost as a joke.

00:00:13.901 --> 00:00:16.144
(phone ringing)

00:00:16.144 --> 00:00:17.394
Floppydisk.com.

00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:23.173
I'm the last man standing
in the floppy disk business,

00:00:23.173 --> 00:00:26.778
because I basically forgot
to get out of the business.

00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:29.647
In this office, we're in a time warp.

00:00:29.647 --> 00:00:31.728
Manufacturing of the diskettes is over,

00:00:31.728 --> 00:00:33.189
and so all of the diskettes

00:00:33.189 --> 00:00:35.898
that will be made have been made.

00:00:35.898 --> 00:00:38.011
I'm desperately trying to acquire

00:00:38.011 --> 00:00:40.773
as many diskettes as I possibly can.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:44.155
All kinds of disks come
flying into our doors.

00:00:44.155 --> 00:00:47.480
From time to time, a commercial
recycler will call me up

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.541
and say, “Hey, I have somewhere between

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:51.909
35 and 50,000 disks.”

00:00:51.909 --> 00:00:53.701
We sort them; we run them through

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:56.336
a process to erase the information.

00:00:56.336 --> 00:00:59.184
Once the diskettes are
reformatted and relabelled,

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:01.351
we're able to resell them.

00:01:03.504 --> 00:01:06.725
We do sell to the U.S. Government.

00:01:06.725 --> 00:01:09.145
There are a number of applications that

00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:12.837
the government has that call
for the use of a floppy disk.

00:01:12.837 --> 00:01:16.079
The old saw is if it
ain't broke don't fix it.

00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:20.165
Most of our business is for
commercial and industrial use,

00:01:20.165 --> 00:01:23.387
whether they be embroidery machines, ATMs,

00:01:23.387 --> 00:01:26.363
avionics for airplanes, those
machines are still around,

00:01:26.363 --> 00:01:29.159
and they're going to last
for quite a few more years.

00:01:29.159 --> 00:01:33.853
The floppy disk business
will not be around forever.

00:01:33.853 --> 00:01:35.839
No, I won't be around forever either.

00:01:35.839 --> 00:01:38.089
(laughing)

